            "content": "[Context: Anomaly Type Definitions for KG Mapping]\nSPIKE, Definition = Transient deviation >3 s , <5 minSingle. SPIKE, Detection Criterion = reading >CRIT. SPIKE, Ontology Class = AnomalyEvent::Spike. DRIFT, Definition = Monotonic deviation >15 min. DRIFT, Detection Criterion = Slope >0.1 s /min for 5+ readingsAnomalyEvent::Drift. DRIFT, Ontology Class = Slope >0.1 s /min for 5+ readingsAnomalyEvent::Drift. STUCK, Definition = Unchanged >10 consecutive. STUCK, Detection Criterion = readings std(last 10)<0.001×nominal. STUCK, Ontology Class = AnomalyEvent::StuckSensor. OUT_OF_RANGE, Definition = Sustained WARN violation >10 min >WARN for 20+. OUT_OF_RANGE, Detection Criterion = readings. OUT_OF_RANGE, Ontology Class = AnomalyEvent::OutOfRange. CORRELATED, Definition = Causally linked to another station Onset within. CORRELATED, Detection Criterion = 90 min of cause. CORRELATED, Ontology Class = AnomalyEvent::Correlated",
